### Requêtes de test - à ouvrir dans VS Code avec l'extension "REST Client" (cliquer sur "Send Request")
@base = http://localhost:8080/api

### Liste des comptes
GET {{base}}/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Créer un compte
POST {{base}}/accounts
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "holder_name": "Jodrick", "iban": "LU280019400644750000" }

### Créditer le compte 2 de 12,50 EUR (montants en centimes)
POST {{base}}/accounts/2/transactions
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "credit", "amount": 1250, "reference": "REF-001" }

### Renvoyer EXACTEMENT la même requête : 200 au lieu de 201, pas de double crédit (idempotence)
POST {{base}}/accounts/2/transactions
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "credit", "amount": 1250, "reference": "REF-001" }

### Débit trop grand : 422 "Solde insuffisant."
POST {{base}}/accounts/2/transactions
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "debit", "amount": 999999, "reference": "REF-002" }

### Virement de 30 EUR du compte 1 vers le compte 2
POST {{base}}/transfers
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "from_account_id": 1, "to_account_id": 2, "amount": 3000, "reference": "TR-001" }

### Historique du compte 2
GET {{base}}/accounts/2/transactions
Accept: application/json


### Tentative de suppression
DELETE {{base}}/accounts/2
Accept: application/json


### Tentative de triche
POST {{base}}/accounts/1/transactions
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "credit", "amount": 100, "reference": "TRICHE-1", "balance_after": 99999999 }


### resumé du compte
GET {{base}}/accounts/2/summary
Accept: application/json